# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# A process that forks after mdir.compile of a GPU program, whose child
# runs it on the GPU (D214): lowering asks NVML for the
# device's architecture and does not initialize the CUDA driver, which a
# forked child could not use. The kernels are cubins for the device.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/fork_after_compile.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: parent: mdir-gpu-lower-to-nvvm{cubin-chip=sm_{{[0-9]+}} cubin-format=bin binary=auto}
# CHECK-NEXT: child: ran 10 steps, potential finite True
# CHECK-NEXT: parent: child exited with 0
